{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f0934246e0ca341248435cdbbeb22400405ec9dbbb6e5c7ec8e9ec91d23aff84", "ja": "雰囲気はMidnight", "zh": "气氛是Midnight", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6823f67e4565a6b64566a3c08b74b5c26f085ba1499353bc871462790d1fbf0b", "ja": "ある日の劇場。通りすがりのプロデューサー\r\nの耳に、アイドル達の『夜遊び』『クラブ』\r\n『ナイトプール』等、チョイ悪な会話が聞こ\r\nえる。まさか？　と顔を出すが……ツアーの\r\n演出案を考えていただけだった。", "zh": "某天的剧场。路过的制作人耳边，传来了偶像们关于“夜生活”“俱乐部”“夜间泳池”等带点坏坏感觉的对话。难道说？制作人探头一看……原来她们只是在考虑巡演的演出方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4babd1c5020ce261b63602c7b585282f7548ab779c9b2559717d58feda75eb76", "ja": "（……おや？　アイドル達が真剣な顔をして、\n何か話し合っている。なんだろう……？）", "zh": "（……咦？偶像们一脸认真，在讨论什么事情。是在说什么呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "7cf6a3143d741c4cb48c7508c123accbd557884013cc527e04e66b7ff3eedfb7", "ja": "うーん……やっぱり、夜遊び、とか？", "zh": "嗯……果然还是去夜游之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "d4d517c72a3d9a66a3f0fa7af1daf3c2046633b48ffded4d6d47e7860f3ae3cd", "ja": "確かに、そういうことよね。\nちょっと危険な匂いがした方がよさそう。", "zh": "确实，就是那种感觉呢。\n带点危险气息，感觉会更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "86db5ce1818cd990af478660f2d1de9c8853f2e00e4dc6a556d2ca963000226e", "ja": "うん、そうだよね。\nきっと、いい子なだけじゃダメなんだと思う。", "zh": "嗯，就是说呀。\n我觉得光是个乖孩子肯定是不行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5b79c89839cdb81fb01f6d60322b79b0e74cd178dd3d05b69ec691c33381c1b0", "ja": "後はやっぱり……せ、セクシーなお店、みたいな？\n私はそういうの、あまり得意じゃないけど……。", "zh": "然后果然还是……性、性感风的店，之类的？\n我虽然不是很擅长应对那种地方就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "aa6162e21c0723d2e65ec4f2756f55fe67312c786938f14a4f3b11a2a6e0c5ae", "ja": "お酒が飲めるところだけじゃなくて、\nクラブとか、ナイトプールみたいなのもいいわよね。", "zh": "不只是能喝酒的地方，\n像俱乐部、夜间泳池之类的也不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "b3262f6117a6545dc9302c05560638600f91857fc3b36ae3a72939e07e707ed3", "ja": "なるほど。\nねおんさいん、夜にはばたく、蝶……。", "zh": "原来如此。霓虹灯牌、在夜色中振翅的蝴蝶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "db633474034414080df2a41efb137253741e5ef8e7d459e00010551b65f0e00e", "ja": "とにかく、皆で一度、試してみるとしましょう。\n実際にやってみなければわからないもの……いざ。", "zh": "总之，先让大家一起试试看吧。\n不亲自试试是不会知道的……那么，开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "18b5e7f95f4e43c08d814642b8aae5cb9709c3413edde204cf14996eda782fdf", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ったっ！", "zh": "等、等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "4fba225a403724200f24f1cfa7ec9d0087a1bcd8c9164b934098b5c0fc31ccc0", "ja": "おや、{$P$}？\nどうなさいましたか？", "zh": "哦，{$P$}？\n您这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "aa98436395b11bd1d0acc66137cce7bf33911f2ec294eb415393ac0137e0aa29", "ja": "ええと……みんな、なんの話をしていたんだ？\n夜遊びとか、危険な匂いとか。貴音や育まで……。", "zh": "呃……大家刚才在聊什么？\n什么夜生活啊、危险的气息啊。就连贵音和育也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "6d66c5382c41a4dd45ce1d49594948f817f2c39f42ddaa2299fc86bd4ca3c4b0", "ja": "あら？　何か勘違いさせてしまったかしら、ふふっ。\n今みんなで、ツアーの演出案を考えていたんですよ。", "zh": "哎呀？是不是让你产生什么误会了，呵呵。\n我们刚才正在一起构思巡演的演出方案呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "167660554bc57d29e6ea5ed6b8508a5f811bda7c1459ac2472b11d11014b375a", "ja": "テーマの『夜』を、突き詰めてみようって。\nコンセプトやイメージを出し合ってたんです。", "zh": "我们正想把主题“夜”进一步挖掘下去。\n刚才在一起讨论概念和形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4f3a18707e6c70c1baa5c471f3f1646c24bc017b37c7580a1e0747be5d596590", "ja": "あ、ああ……なるほど、そういうことか。\nよかった、ホッとしたよ。", "zh": "啊，啊啊……原来是这么回事。\n太好了，真是松了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "84122189bdc08ea677df7bf6bab7a01b6067e1c63a09882d797adc798765f2ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、夜のイメージって\nなにかある？　あったら聞かせて！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你对夜晚有什么\n印象吗？有的话讲给我听听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "80f520beb9a6c84a25f8c0e71c5d026510f464f515b8ce7c0d1a96e829398b73", "ja": "えっ？　そうだなぁ……夜か、うーん。\n……残業とか？", "zh": "啊？这个嘛……夜晚啊，嗯……加班之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f6a93e42660765ac86cdda0a21bea7e8b17e0d644d9d5f6046c3fc0392c465f5", "ja": "ま、まあとにかく。\n無理に背伸びをする必要はないと思うんだけど。", "zh": "总、总之，我觉得没必要勉强逞强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "5a4c687e430fed51c6c6404553f2b2658256e43a3ebb21bacc84a0fbdefdde72", "ja": "えー、わたし、背伸びなんてしてないもん！\nとうしん大だよ。", "zh": "诶——我才没有硬装成熟呢！\n我可是等身大哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cfff4768ff8d53e0fdf3dfdfe1b02b5858f65bc2d21a1438b4793df82537e6cb", "ja": "そうか……とりあえず、演出については任せるから。\n自由に考えてみてくれ。", "zh": "这样啊……总之，演出方面就交给你了。\n你自由发挥，想想看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "7d0219294bf98338ca39059113e95a66b21e49f55f7a47430a633c2c27570752", "ja": "ふふ♪　ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、みんなでレッスンルームに行きましょうか！", "zh": "呵呵♪谢谢您。\n那么，我们一起去练习室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8621456d5e52e3de3f035c568ff411cbf0db14bc50d57b66f0ee9058661be4f0", "ja": "（テーマが腑に落ちるまで、もう少し掛かりそうだな。\nみんながどんな答えを出すか、楽しみにしておこう！）", "zh": "（看来还要再花些时间，大家才能真正理解这个主题。就期待一下大家会给出怎样的答案吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
